<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Investment sets US$80 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Investment sets US$80 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Schroders Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER GUANGDONG INVESTMENT LTD	   GUARANTOR   - -</p>
<p> AMT	US$80 MLN   COUPON    6ML+140    MATURITY    5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    30.AUG.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YRS 3, 4    CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     18.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS CUSTOMARY  PAY DATE    MID-OCT</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY HONG KONG  TAX PROV    STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES    EUROCLEAR/CEDEL CLEARING. BORROWER IS 38 PCT HELD BY</p>
<p>	    GUANGDONG ENTERPRISE HOLDINGS, WHICH IS RATED BB BY</p>
<p>	    S&amp;P AND BA1 BY MOODY'S</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-ARGRS  US$10  MLN+ 90   BP ALL-IN 170</p>
<p>			    CO-MGRS   US$5-9 MLN  82.5 BP ALL-IN 167.5</p>
<p>			    MANAGERS  US$3-4 MLN  75   BP ALL-IN 165</p>
<p>ARRANGER SCHRODERS ASIA</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
